261
00:22:05,280 --> 00:22:06,960
As a woman,

262
00:22:07,840 --> 00:22:10,280
I'm deeply saddened
by what Flora went through.

263
00:22:12,640 --> 00:22:13,840
This time…

264
00:22:16,560 --> 00:22:17,960
we have to call the police.

265
00:22:19,080 --> 00:22:20,160
Yes.

266
00:22:20,240 --> 00:22:21,400
We should call the police.

267
00:22:21,920 --> 00:22:22,760
Call the police.

268
00:22:22,840 --> 00:22:24,400
Someone like him must be punished.

269
00:22:43,320 --> 00:22:45,160
Dony has powerful connections.

270
00:22:45,240 --> 00:22:48,360
We don't know how far
the investigation will go.

271
00:22:51,000 --> 00:22:52,480
But I want to make one thing clear.

272
00:22:52,560 --> 00:22:55,680
Luke and I will make sure
he goes to prison.

273
00:22:58,520 --> 00:22:59,360
I know.

274
00:23:00,200 --> 00:23:01,120
I'm not afraid.

275
00:23:01,960 --> 00:23:04,080
I just want him
to be punished for what he did.

276
00:23:07,720 --> 00:23:11,040
Flora, the first time I met you,

277
00:23:11,120 --> 00:23:14,160
I knew you were
an extraordinary young woman.

278
00:23:15,160 --> 00:23:17,240
I went against everyone else to hire you.

279
00:23:18,760 --> 00:23:22,480
Looking back, it was a great decision.

280
00:23:25,200 --> 00:23:26,240
Thank you.

281
00:23:27,520 --> 00:23:29,080
Thank you for always believing in me.

282
00:23:40,600 --> 00:23:41,760
Ms. Shang,

283
00:23:42,360 --> 00:23:46,800
Headquarters takes the complaint you filed
against Dony Chen very seriously.

284
00:23:46,880 --> 00:23:48,440
But the situation now

285
00:23:48,520 --> 00:23:52,320
is extremely complicated
and highly sensitive.

286
00:23:52,920 --> 00:23:54,080
Although the police
have opened a criminal case,

287
00:23:54,160 --> 00:23:55,680
this is ultimately
an internal matter at Lime.

288
00:23:55,760 --> 00:23:58,880
Issuing a public statement
could cause immeasurable damage

289
00:23:58,960 --> 00:24:01,000
to the company's reputation
and share price.

290
00:24:01,080 --> 00:24:02,600
We understand what you've been through,

291
00:24:02,680 --> 00:24:05,640
but we still hope you'll settle the matter
privately within the company.

292
00:24:06,440 --> 00:24:07,280
Of course,

293
00:24:07,360 --> 00:24:10,320
the company is prepared to offer you
substantial financial compensation

294
00:24:10,400 --> 00:24:11,400
and job security.

295
00:24:14,000 --> 00:24:15,680
Thank you for the offer,

296
00:24:16,440 --> 00:24:18,280
but what I want is justice.

297
00:24:19,120 --> 00:24:22,720
Agreeing to a settlement
would allow a criminal

298
00:24:22,800 --> 00:24:24,000
to continue to walk free.

299
00:24:24,080 --> 00:24:26,200
I trust the company
won't handle it that way.

300
00:24:26,280 --> 00:24:29,600
But the recording you submitted
doesn't clearly establish what happened.

301
00:24:29,680 --> 00:24:31,080
It alone isn't enough
to secure a conviction.

302
00:24:35,120 --> 00:24:39,040
What I want is for Dony Chen
to be punished for sexual harassment.

303
00:24:39,560 --> 00:24:40,560
Just because he got away with it before

304
00:24:40,640 --> 00:24:42,680
doesn't mean every woman
is an easy target.

305
00:24:43,360 --> 00:24:44,680
I won't settle.

306
00:24:53,800 --> 00:24:54,840
This contains evidence

307
00:24:55,440 --> 00:24:57,600
that he tried to force himself on me
and sexually harassed me.

308
00:25:03,960 --> 00:25:05,320
I was instructed to trace the funds

309
00:25:05,400 --> 00:25:08,800
flowing through the high-end tea shops
Dony selected and Lanyuan.

310
00:25:09,400 --> 00:25:12,960
The money ultimately went
into a private overseas account.

311
00:25:35,840 --> 00:25:38,480
These are the materials
I gathered for my complaint against Dony.

312
00:26:14,240 --> 00:26:15,640
A recording isn't foolproof.

313
00:26:16,640 --> 00:26:18,840
What if things had gotten out of control?

314
00:26:20,520 --> 00:26:23,760
I'd already made arrangements
with Kitty and Lucy.

315
00:26:24,920 --> 00:26:26,400
I knew I wouldn't be in any danger.

316
00:26:29,080 --> 00:26:30,720
You were in Hangzhou for 13 days.

317
00:26:31,640 --> 00:26:33,920
We spoke on the phone 26 times.

318
00:26:34,520 --> 00:26:36,920
Yet you never said a word
about any of this.

319
00:26:39,880 --> 00:26:41,000
I want to know why.

320
00:26:43,600 --> 00:26:46,600
You were already under intense scrutiny.

321
00:26:46,680 --> 00:26:49,480
I… I didn't want
to cause you more trouble.

322
00:26:59,320 --> 00:27:01,400
Correct me if I'm wrong, but I asked you.

323
00:27:02,400 --> 00:27:04,120
I asked whether Dony had harassed you,

324
00:27:04,840 --> 00:27:05,880
and you said no.

325
00:27:12,080 --> 00:27:13,360
Good for you, Shang Zhitao.

326
00:27:14,440 --> 00:27:18,120
You're so strong now
that you don't need anyone to protect you.

327
00:27:19,320 --> 00:27:20,960
Clearheaded and independent.

328
00:27:21,840 --> 00:27:23,800
I can hardly resist applauding you.

329
00:27:29,960 --> 00:27:30,960
Luan Nian.

330
00:27:35,120 --> 00:27:36,520
I'm exhausted. I…

331
00:27:36,600 --> 00:27:38,400
I just want to go home and sleep.

332
00:27:41,680 --> 00:27:42,920
You've certainly been through a lot.

333
00:27:43,440 --> 00:27:44,600
Go home and rest.

334
00:28:08,600 --> 00:28:09,960
<i>Good for you, Shang Zhitao.</i>

335
00:28:10,040 --> 00:28:13,960
<i>You're so strong now</i>
<i>that you don't need anyone to protect you.</i>

336
00:28:33,760 --> 00:28:34,840
It's over now.

337
00:28:34,920 --> 00:28:35,960
Everything's OK.

338
00:28:53,840 --> 00:28:54,760
You're here, right?

339
00:28:55,720 --> 00:28:57,160
I'll bring her down now.

340
00:29:09,920 --> 00:29:11,600
According to our investigation,

341
00:29:11,680 --> 00:29:13,800
Dony may be involved
in more than just this case.

342
00:29:14,320 --> 00:29:16,280
There is also evidence of embezzlement
and other illegal activity.

343
00:29:16,360 --> 00:29:18,400
Dony was hired by Headquarters,

344
00:29:18,480 --> 00:29:21,000
and his background check
was never handled by Lime China.

345
00:29:21,080 --> 00:29:23,240
The group also made a serious error
in appointing him.

346
00:29:25,840 --> 00:29:28,840
None of the materials you've provided
have been verified.

347
00:29:28,920 --> 00:29:31,320
Some are even complaint records
from years ago,

348
00:29:31,400 --> 00:29:33,880
from different companies
with different systems.

349
00:29:34,400 --> 00:29:35,400
Moreover,

350
00:29:35,480 --> 00:29:39,680
none of them resulted in any substantive
disciplinary action or legal consequences.

351
00:29:40,400 --> 00:29:44,680
Luke, you and Dony disagreed
over the New Media strategy.

352
00:29:44,760 --> 00:29:45,880
If you use company resources

353
00:29:45,960 --> 00:29:48,000
to investigate his private life
from years ago because of that,

354
00:29:48,600 --> 00:29:50,120
it'll be a serious breach
of management principles

355
00:29:50,200 --> 00:29:51,760
and could constitute
an abuse of authority.

356
00:29:51,840 --> 00:29:54,960
Of course, we will review
the matter carefully,

357
00:29:55,560 --> 00:29:59,640
but we must also consider the company's
overall stability and reputation.

358
00:30:03,760 --> 00:30:06,080
I don't know whose interests
Dony truly represents,

359
00:30:06,720 --> 00:30:10,480
but this disastrous appointment
proves the company has no trust in me.

360
00:30:15,680 --> 00:30:18,040
Today, I resign
from every position I hold at Lime.

361
00:31:47,280 --> 00:31:47,960
Hello?

362
00:31:48,040 --> 00:31:49,680
The board is in an uproar.

363
00:31:49,760 --> 00:31:51,440
They want you online for a meeting.

364
00:31:51,520 --> 00:31:52,640
I'm not going.

365
00:31:54,600 --> 00:31:56,000
People are already
talking about it online,

366
00:31:56,080 --> 00:31:57,640
<i>and the share price is falling.</i>

367
00:31:58,160 --> 00:31:59,040
Serves them right.

368
00:32:00,920 --> 00:32:01,920
So,

369
00:32:03,240 --> 00:32:04,160
are you really resigning?

370
00:32:04,760 --> 00:32:05,600
Yes.

371
00:32:09,920 --> 00:32:11,680
It's fine to teach them a lesson,

372
00:32:11,760 --> 00:32:15,280
<i>but resigning wasn't part of our plan.</i>

373
00:32:16,760 --> 00:32:18,440
I'm not trying to teach them a lesson.

374
00:32:18,960 --> 00:32:20,520
I really am resigning.

375
00:32:21,720 --> 00:32:22,880
Are you sure you're serious?

376
00:32:22,960 --> 00:32:24,160
I am.

377
00:32:25,280 --> 00:32:26,880
Tell the board
to find a replacement quickly.

378
00:32:26,960 --> 00:32:28,640
I'm taking leave starting today.

379
00:32:48,640 --> 00:32:53,120
<i>The flight from Hangzhou to Beijing</i>
<i>covers 1,520 kilometers.</i>

380
00:32:54,240 --> 00:32:55,800
<i>I was trembling the entire way.</i>

381
00:32:57,000 --> 00:32:58,680
<i>Keep this up, and I'll scream.</i>

382
00:32:58,760 --> 00:32:59,960
<i>Let go of me!</i>

383
00:33:01,480 --> 00:33:04,360
<i>You were already under intense scrutiny.</i>

384
00:33:04,440 --> 00:33:06,240
<i>I didn't want to cause you more trouble.</i>

385
00:33:18,280 --> 00:33:19,120
SHANG ZHITAO

386
00:33:24,360 --> 00:33:25,520
<i>Hello?</i>

387
00:33:25,600 --> 00:33:26,480
Hello?

388
00:33:27,160 --> 00:33:29,160
Hello. This is Luan Nian.

389
00:33:30,000 --> 00:33:31,400
May I speak to Shang Zhitao?

390
00:33:32,120 --> 00:33:33,440
Tao is asleep.

391
00:33:36,320 --> 00:33:37,680
<i>She's exhausted.</i>

392
00:33:38,440 --> 00:33:41,400
<i>When she wakes up,</i>
<i>I'll tell her you called.</i>

393
00:33:41,480 --> 00:33:43,240
- <i>OK?</i>
- OK.

394
00:33:44,560 --> 00:33:45,440
Thank you.

395
00:33:59,440 --> 00:34:04,640
TIANTONG DONGYUAN, SECTION 1

396
00:34:21,719 --> 00:34:22,560
Hello?

397
00:34:22,639 --> 00:34:24,719
<i>Sun Yu said you called me.</i>

398
00:34:26,800 --> 00:34:27,679
I did.

399
00:34:28,320 --> 00:34:29,400
What is it?

400
00:34:31,480 --> 00:34:32,480
I came to apologize.

401
00:34:35,480 --> 00:34:36,760
<i>I'm downstairs.</i>

402
00:34:47,719 --> 00:34:49,520
There's no rush. Take your time.

403
00:36:28,800 --> 00:36:30,040
I want to see the moon.

404
00:36:36,760 --> 00:36:37,600
OK.

405
00:36:58,640 --> 00:37:00,920
Kitty said she was terrified.

406
00:37:03,800 --> 00:37:04,800
Were you scared?

407
00:37:19,720 --> 00:37:20,840
We agreed

408
00:37:21,800 --> 00:37:23,080
to be honest with each other.

409
00:37:25,640 --> 00:37:27,680
But you had plenty of people around you,

410
00:37:27,760 --> 00:37:30,200
so you never needed to ask me for help.

411
00:37:31,120 --> 00:37:32,880
You wouldn't even tell me the truth.

412
00:37:35,200 --> 00:37:37,200
I didn't feel it was my place to tell you.

413
00:37:38,000 --> 00:37:40,720
It involved Kitty's privacy.

414
00:37:40,800 --> 00:37:42,600
Then why was it your place to tell others?

415
00:37:43,560 --> 00:37:44,720
Who do you mean?

416
00:37:45,440 --> 00:37:47,960
Throughout all of this,
I was the last to know.

417
00:37:50,160 --> 00:37:51,400
Shang Zhitao.

418
00:37:52,400 --> 00:37:53,960
Do you even see me as your boyfriend?

419
00:37:55,680 --> 00:37:58,800
Luan Nian, don't talk like that.

420
00:37:59,600 --> 00:38:01,440
Of course I see you as my boyfriend.

421
00:38:15,160 --> 00:38:16,200
Luan Nian.

422
00:38:20,680 --> 00:38:21,840
I've learned my lesson.

423
00:38:23,320 --> 00:38:24,560
It won't happen again.

424
00:38:51,400 --> 00:38:52,240
Your punishment.

425
00:38:59,680 --> 00:39:03,200
Lumi said you're resigning?

426
00:39:06,640 --> 00:39:07,960
Because of me?

427
00:39:08,040 --> 00:39:09,440
Because I'm rich.

428
00:39:09,960 --> 00:39:11,920
I can quit whenever I want.

429
00:39:18,120 --> 00:39:22,520
Could you not resign
and keep being my boss?

430
00:39:23,440 --> 00:39:25,240
I like working with you.

431
00:39:25,760 --> 00:39:27,720
I feel like I learn a lot.

432
00:39:28,240 --> 00:39:29,800
And…

433
00:39:32,720 --> 00:39:34,800
I get to see you often.

434
00:40:11,640 --> 00:40:13,440
LMAD STOCK PRICE

435
00:40:29,320 --> 00:40:31,200
Luke, when are you going back to work?

436
00:40:34,600 --> 00:40:35,440
I'm not.

437
00:40:37,240 --> 00:40:40,000
Running this bar must cost quite a bit.

438
00:40:42,040 --> 00:40:43,200
It's manageable.

439
00:40:43,280 --> 00:40:45,560
I can afford it.

440
00:40:46,800 --> 00:40:47,640
Luke,

441
00:40:47,720 --> 00:40:51,040
you can have full control
of Lime China from now on.

442
00:40:51,120 --> 00:40:53,080
You've all come all the way from the US.

443
00:40:53,160 --> 00:40:54,920
I know it wasn't an easy trip.

444
00:40:55,000 --> 00:40:56,040
Enjoy yourselves tonight.

445
00:40:56,120 --> 00:40:57,560
The drinks are on me.

446
00:40:57,640 --> 00:40:59,120
Then go back and get some sleep.

447
00:40:59,200 --> 00:41:00,360
Just name your terms.

448
00:41:01,960 --> 00:41:04,360
Then process my resignation
as soon as possible.

449
00:41:08,280 --> 00:41:09,120
Luke,

450
00:41:09,880 --> 00:41:12,080
we came here in good faith.

451
00:41:12,160 --> 00:41:14,320
Why don't you tell us
what you have in mind?

452
00:41:15,800 --> 00:41:18,360
What Dony did
caused our employees great harm.

453
00:41:18,960 --> 00:41:20,880
If the group won't even offer
a sincere apology,

454
00:41:21,400 --> 00:41:22,920
how can our employees feel secure?

455
00:41:25,360 --> 00:41:26,880
Yes. Right.

456
00:41:27,440 --> 00:41:28,520
We completely agree.

457
00:41:31,400 --> 00:41:32,240
How about this?

458
00:41:32,760 --> 00:41:34,800
Tell us what you propose.

459
00:41:34,880 --> 00:41:36,000
We'll do it.

460
00:41:40,960 --> 00:41:41,960
I have two proposals.

461
00:41:43,280 --> 00:41:46,960
The complainants have the legal right
not to withdraw the case.

462
00:41:47,040 --> 00:41:48,080
First,

463
00:41:48,640 --> 00:41:51,720
as an apology, the company will grant
immediately exercisable stock options

464
00:41:52,560 --> 00:41:55,320
worth 200,000 yuan to the lead complainant

465
00:41:55,400 --> 00:41:57,160
and options worth 100,000 yuan
to each of the other four.

466
00:41:57,800 --> 00:42:00,120
It will be treated
as a confidential special award.

467
00:42:00,680 --> 00:42:01,520
Second,

468
00:42:02,760 --> 00:42:05,480
the group must not interfere
in personnel appointments at Lime China.

469
00:42:07,080 --> 00:42:09,120
They won't withdraw the case,
and we're compensating them?

470
00:42:13,640 --> 00:42:15,480
The complainants' lives
may even be at risk.

471
00:42:16,000 --> 00:42:17,280
If they go to the press with the details,

472
00:42:18,360 --> 00:42:19,520
Lime's stock could hit

473
00:42:20,240 --> 00:42:21,840
its daily loss limit
for five straight days.

474
00:42:26,440 --> 00:42:27,760
Go back and discuss it.

475
00:42:27,840 --> 00:42:30,360
Handle it properly, and I'll return.

476
00:42:48,040 --> 00:42:50,360
Are you firing me?

477
00:42:52,360 --> 00:42:54,080
You're so good at your job. Why would we?

478
00:42:54,720 --> 00:42:55,720
Take a look.

479
00:43:00,520 --> 00:43:02,400
STOCK GRANT AGREEMENT

480
00:43:03,360 --> 00:43:07,680
You know the company awards stock
to certain employees every year, right?

481
00:43:08,360 --> 00:43:10,680
Aren't stock awards
only for specialist-level employees?

482
00:43:10,760 --> 00:43:14,040
This is a special stock award
from the company.

483
00:43:14,120 --> 00:43:15,600
I didn't do it for money.

484
00:43:16,880 --> 00:43:18,080
Don't worry.

485
00:43:18,600 --> 00:43:20,360
The grant will be confidential.

486
00:43:21,600 --> 00:43:26,760
Thank you for making our workplace safer.

487
00:43:26,840 --> 00:43:29,760
Without your courage and resourcefulness,

488
00:43:29,840 --> 00:43:31,480
he wouldn't have been brought to justice.

489
00:43:34,720 --> 00:43:35,560
Here.

490
00:43:47,400 --> 00:43:49,120
Thank you, Tracy.

491
00:43:52,000 --> 00:43:55,120
This was also one of Luke's conditions
for returning to work.

492
00:44:03,280 --> 00:44:05,360
<i>Thanks to Flora's persistence,</i>

493
00:44:05,440 --> 00:44:07,120
<i>Dony has received</i>
<i>the punishment he deserved.</i>

494
00:44:07,200 --> 00:44:08,760
<i>With the evidence we provided,</i>

495
00:44:08,840 --> 00:44:12,400
<i>he was convicted of embezzlement</i>
<i>and forcible indecency and insult,</i>

496
00:44:12,480 --> 00:44:14,560
<i>and sentenced to 11 years in prison.</i>

497
00:44:15,240 --> 00:44:16,120
<i>You can come back now.</i>

498
00:44:16,200 --> 00:44:17,480
<i>Stay away much longer,</i>

499
00:44:17,560 --> 00:44:20,320
and the board might replace you outright.

500
00:44:21,240 --> 00:44:22,160
That'd be great.

501
00:44:22,680 --> 00:44:25,360
I'll start another company
and steal Lime's business.

502
00:44:28,040 --> 00:44:30,120
Come back to work, my junior brother.

503
00:44:31,680 --> 00:44:32,600
Next week.

504
00:44:43,720 --> 00:44:44,680
Luke.

505
00:44:47,200 --> 00:44:48,040
Paw.

506
00:44:50,440 --> 00:44:51,400
Silly.

507
00:44:53,440 --> 00:44:54,840
Stay. Sit.

508
00:45:17,680 --> 00:45:18,840
<i>I'm doomed.</i>

509
00:45:18,920 --> 00:45:22,080
New user sign-ups hit another record low.

510
00:45:22,160 --> 00:45:24,560
I've almost burned through
all the investors' money.

511
00:45:24,640 --> 00:45:28,640
What was I thinking,
trying to start a business?

512
00:45:31,040 --> 00:45:32,760
Everything takes time.

513
00:45:32,840 --> 00:45:33,840
Don't rush.

514
00:45:33,920 --> 00:45:36,600
I've tried every kind of promotion,

515
00:45:36,680 --> 00:45:38,120
but nothing's working.

516
00:45:38,200 --> 00:45:39,520
What do I do?

517
00:45:43,480 --> 00:45:44,560
Tell you what.

518
00:45:44,640 --> 00:45:46,480
I'll sign up right now and download it.

519
00:45:46,560 --> 00:45:47,760
Zhu, download it too.

520
00:45:47,840 --> 00:45:49,240
Every user counts.

521
00:45:49,320 --> 00:45:51,160
And we're real, live users.

522
00:45:51,240 --> 00:45:53,240
When Lei gets back,
we'll have him download it too.

523
00:45:53,320 --> 00:45:55,560
And I'll promote it at work. OK?

524
00:45:56,200 --> 00:45:57,280
Really?

525
00:45:58,520 --> 00:46:02,440
Having you two as users
